  (@custom "contractspecv0" (after data) "\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\84Two-tier pause (L0-15). mode 1 = halt-open: opens and non-reduce-only\0aorder placement are blocked (#4), but closes, liquidations, stops and\0across deposit/withdraw still work \e2\80\94 traders can always de-risk and exit.\0amode 2 = full-freeze: even those are blocked symmetrically (#90); only\0acancel_order works, and it auto-degrades to mode 1 after 72h. mode must\0abe 1 or 2 (use unpause for 0).\00\00\00\05pause\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\04mode\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\03\ed\00\00\00\00\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0cNoetherError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\16Resume fully (mode 0).\00\00\00\00\00\07unpause\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\03\ed\00\00\00\00\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0cNoetherError\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\80Swap the running WASM in place; all storage (positions, orders,\0across balances) is preserved across the upgrade.\0a\0a\e2\9a\a0\ef\b8\8f When the new wasm's `MarketConfig` has MORE fields than the stored\0aone, every config-reading entry point traps until `migrate_config`\0arewrites it (Soroban decodes structs by exact field set). Pause \e2\86\92\0aupgrade \e2\86\92 migrate_config \e2\86\92 unpause. See `migrate_config`.\00\00\00\07upgrade\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0dnew_wasm_hash\00\00\00\00\00\03\ee\00\00\00 \00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\03\ed\00\00\00\00\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0cNoetherError\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\8bForce-realize a winning position at the oracle mark while ADL is\0aactive for its asset (L0-1). Permissionless \e2\80\94 the on-chain gates\0a(flag active + net winner) are the consensus; the keeper's ranking\0awalk is advisory ordering. Pause-exempt (same class as liquidate).\0aThe trader is paid in full through the normal close settlement and\0aoptionally compensated from the buffer (adl_compensation_bps).\00\00\00\00\09adl_close\00\00\00\00\00\00\02\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06caller\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0bposition_id\00\00\00\00\06\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\00\0b\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0cNoetherError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\1bGet a specific order by ID.\00\00\00\00\09get_order\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\08order_id\00\00\00\06\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e8\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\05Order\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\b9Liquidate an underwater position.\0aCallable by anyone (keeper). Keeper receives liquidation reward.\0a\0a# Arguments\0a* `keeper` - Address executing the liquidation (receives reward)\0a* `position_id` - ID of position to liquidate\0a\0a# Returns\0aKeeper reward amount\0a\0a# Flow\0a1. Verify position is liquidatable\0a2. Calculate remaining equity and keeper reward\0a3. Pay keeper their reward\0a4. Transfer remaining collateral to Vault\0a5. Update Vault accounting\00\00\00\00\00\00\09liquidate\00\00\00\00\00\00\02\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06keeper\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0bposition_id\00\00\00\00\06\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\00\0b\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0cNoetherError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\b0Rotate the admin (R-11: the multisig migration path). Both current\0aand new admin must sign \e2\80\94 a one-sided rotation to a mistyped\0aaddress would brick every admin power forever.\00\00\00\09set_admin\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\09new_admin\00\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\03\ed\00\00\00\00\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0cNoetherError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0ainitialize\00\00\00\00\00\05\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\05admin\00\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0eoracle_adapter\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\05vault\00\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0ausdc_token\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06config\00\00\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0cMarketConfig\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\03\ed\00\00\00\00\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0cNoetherError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\b2Cancel a pending order.\0aFor limit orders, refunds the locked collateral.\0a\0a# Arguments\0a* `trader` - Address of the trader (must own order)\0a* `order_id` - ID of the order to cancel\00\00\00\00\00\0ccancel_order\00\00\00\02\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06trader\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\08order_id\00\00\00\06\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\03\ed\00\00\00\00\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0cNoetherError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\15Get a position by ID.\00\00\00\00\00\00\0cget_position\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0bposition_id\00\00\00\00\06\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e8\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\08Position\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\e0L1-18: wire the referral registry. Every fee-bearing open then\0atry-invokes referral.record_trade for the discount/payout split;\0aunset (or a broken registry) is a silent no-op \e2\80\94 fail-open, trading\0anever blocks on referrals.\00\00\00\0cset_referral\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\08referral\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\03\ed\00\00\00\00\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0cNoetherError\00\00\00\00\00\00\02\e4Apply funding to all positions (can be called periodically).\0aFunding balances long/short interest:\0a- If more longs than shorts: longs pay shorts\0a- If more shorts than longs: shorts pay longs\0aApply per-market funding (L0-13). Permissionless, same no-arg\0asignature the keeper already calls. Loops every listed pair and\0aaccrues each asset's own SIP-279 velocity-based rate (clamped),\0adriven by that asset's TIME-WEIGHTED skew \e2\80\94 so a quiet pair cannot\0acollect carry off another pair's imbalance, and a keeper outage\0aunder-accrues (the dt cap kills the M-7 retroactive window) rather\0athan pricing hours at one instant's skew. Returns\0aFundingIntervalNotElapsed (#55) only when NOTHING was due, preserving\0athe keeper's applied|not-due tri-state.\00\00\00\0dapply_funding\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\03\ed\00\00\00\00\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0cNoetherError\00\00\00\00\00\00\01$Execute a triggered order (called by keeper).\0aChecks if price condition is met and executes the order.\0aKeeper receives a fee for successful execution.\0a\0a# Arguments\0a* `keeper` - Address of the keeper executing the order\0a* `order_id` - ID of the order to execute\0a\0a# Returns\0aKeeper reward amount\00\00\00\0dexecute_order\00\00\00\00\00\00\02\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06keeper\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\08order_id\00\00\00\06\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\00\0b\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0cNoetherError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00#Whether ADL is active for an asset.\00\00\00\00\0dis_adl_active\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\05asset\00\00\00\00\00\00\11\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\f6Open a new leveraged position.\0a\0a# Arguments\0a* `trader` - Address of the trader\0a* `asset` - Asset symbol (e.g., \22XLM\22)\0a* `collateral` - USDC collateral amount (7 decimals)\0a* `leverage` - Leverage multiplier (1-10)\0a* `direction` - Long or Short\0a\0a# Returns\0aThe created Position\0a\0a# Flow\0a1. Validate parameters\0a2. Check Vault liquidity for potential payout\0a3. Fetch price from oracle\0a4. Calculate position size and liquidation price\0a5. Transfer collateral from trader\0a6. Deduct trading fee\0a7. Store position\00\00\00\00\00\0dopen_position\00\00\00\00\00\00\06\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06trader\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\05asset\00\00\00\00\00\00\11\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0acollateral\00\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\08leverage\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\09direction\00\00\00\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\09Direction\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\10acceptable_price\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\08Position\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0cNoetherError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\8fRoute a share of trading fees to a treasury address (insurance /\0aoperations funding). bps is the protocol share in basis points,\0acapped at 50%.\00\00\00\00\0dset_fee_split\00\00\00\00\00\00\02\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\08treasury\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\03bps\00\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\03\ed\00\00\00\00\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0cNoetherError\00\00\00\00\00\00\01kSet a stop-loss order on an existing position.\0aAutomatically closes the position when price reaches trigger to limit losses.\0a\0a# Arguments\0a* `trader` - Address of the trader (must own position)\0a* `position_id` - ID of the position to protect\0a* `trigger_price` - Price at which to close (7 decimals)\0a* `slippage_tolerance_bps` - Max allowed slippage in basis points\00\00\00\00\0dset_stop_loss\00\00\00\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06trader\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0bposition_id\00\00\00\00\06\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0dtrigger_price\00\00\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\16slippage_tolerance_bps\00\00\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\05Order\00\00\00\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0cNoetherError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\ceAdd collateral to an isolated position (L0-6), moving its liquidation\0aprice further away. Risk-REDUCING \e2\80\94 deliberately NOT pause-gated\0a(exit-only-pause philosophy, L0-15). Cross uses deposit_cross_margin.\00\00\00\00\00\0eadd_collateral\00\00\00\00\00\03\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06trader\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0bposition_id\00\00\00\00\06\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06amount\00\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\03\ed\00\00\00\00\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0cNoetherError\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\abClose an existing position.\0a\0a# Arguments\0a* `trader` - Address of the trader (must own position)\0a* `position_id` - ID of position to close\0a\0a# Returns\0aFinal PnL amount (positive = profit, negative = loss)\0a\0a# Flow\0a1. Verify ownership\0a2. Apply any pending funding\0a3. Calculate PnL at current price\0a4. Settle with vault (handles fund transfer for wins)\0a5. Transfer loss to vault if trader lost\0a6. Return collateral +/- PnL to trader\00\00\00\00\0eclose_position\00\00\00\00\00\03\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06trader\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0bposition_id\00\00\00\00\06\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\10acceptable_price\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\00\0b\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0cNoetherError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\83Per-market risk params for an asset (L0-12) \e2\80\94 the single source of\0atruth the keeper (simulate) and gateway (contractReader) read.\00\00\00\00\0eget_asset_risk\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\05asset\00\00\00\00\00\00\11\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e8\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0fAssetRiskParams\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\c2Overwrite the stored `MarketConfig` WITHOUT reading the old value.\0a\0aA Soroban struct is stored as an exact field map, so after an\0a`upgrade` that adds config fields the old value no longer decodes:\0a`get_config` traps with `UnexpectedSize` and the market is bricked\0auntil this runs. This entry point never reads the old config, so it\0ais callable in that state \e2\80\94 the one-way door out of a config-shape\0aupgrade. Admin-only; validated like `initialize`.\00\00\00\00\00\0emigrate_config\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06config\00\00\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0cMarketConfig\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\03\ed\00\00\00\00\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0cNoetherError\00\00\00\00\00\00\01CEmergency admin tool (2026-08 funding-counterparty upgrade): reset the\0afunding baseline of the given positions to the current per-asset\0aindex, voiding their pending funding. Refuses unless the market is in\0afull-freeze (mode 2) so nothing settles mid-reseed. Unknown ids are\0askipped; returns the number of positions touched.\00\00\00\00\0ereseed_funding\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\03ids\00\00\00\03\ea\00\00\00\06\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\00\04\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0cNoetherError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\d2L1-24: halt/resume trading in ONE market (admin). While halted, risk-\0aincreasing ops on the asset revert #92; closing/liquidating/cancelling\0astill works \e2\80\94 one broken feed no longer forces a whole-venue pause.\00\00\00\00\00\0eset_asset_halt\00\00\00\00\00\02\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\05asset\00\00\00\00\00\00\11\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06halted\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\03\ed\00\00\00\00\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0cNoetherError\00\00\00\00\00\00\01HSet per-market risk params (L0-12). Admin-only. The asset must be a\0alisted pair and params must satisfy the MM=IM/2 ladder invariant.\0aThe first successful call stamps RiskEpochTs, activating the ladder:\0afrom then on risk-increasing ops on UNconfigured assets fail #88,\0awhile positions opened before the stamp keep the legacy MM.\00\00\00\0eset_asset_risk\00\00\00\00\00\02\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\05asset\00\00\00\00\00\00\11\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06params\00\00\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0fAssetRiskParams\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\03\ed\00\00\00\00\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0cNoetherError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\caPermissionless NAV freshener: recompute one asset's unrealized\0atrader PnL at the current oracle price and push it to the vault,\0aso NOE pricing tracks the market between trades. Returns the\0apushed value.\00\00\00\00\00\0esync_asset_pnl\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\05asset\00\00\00\00\00\00\11\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\00\0b\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0cNoetherError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00kCurrent pause state as (mode, since). mode reflects the 72h auto-degrade\0alogically (read-only, no persist).\00\00\00\00\0fget_pause_state\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\ed\00\00\00\02\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\06\00\00\00\00\00\00\00)L1-24 view: whether one market is halted.\00\00\00\00\00\00\0fis_asset_halted\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\05asset\00\00\00\00\00\00\11\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\01CMigrate the single global funding index into per-asset indices\0a(L0-13). Admin-only, run inside the upgrade pause window after\0amigrate_config + set_asset_risk. Seeds every pair's index at the\0alegacy global cumulative value so every open position's pending\0afunding is preserved by delta-continuity \e2\80\94 no per-position writes.\00\00\00\00\0fmigrate_funding\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\03\ed\00\00\00\00\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0cNoetherError\00\00\00\00\00\00\01eSet a take-profit order on an existing position.\0aAutomatically closes the position when price reaches trigger to lock in profits.\0a\0a# Arguments\0a* `trader` - Address of the trader (must own position)\0a* `position_id` - ID of the position\0a* `trigger_price` - Price at which to close (7 decimals)\0a* `slippage_tolerance_bps` - Max allowed slippage in basis points\00\00\00\00\00\00\0fset_take_profit\00\00\00\00\05\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06trader\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0bposition_id\00\00\00\00\06\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0dtrigger_price\00\00\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\16slippage_tolerance_bps\00\00\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0blimit_price\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\05Order\00\00\00\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0cNoetherError\00\00\00\00\00\00\02\d8One-shot bootstrap of the live counters for a market upgraded in\0aplace: the counter keys do not exist in pre-upgrade storage, so\0adecrements would saturate at zero and the counts would under-report\0aforever. Admin derives the true open totals (a ledger-entry walk of\0aPosition/Order ids \e2\80\94 the same walk the keeper runs) and writes them\0ahere, exactly once. The latch is a DEDICATED marker, NOT the counter\0akey: closes and liquidations run even while paused and their\0asaturating decrement CREATES the counter key at zero, which must not\0alock the admin out of seeding. Seeding overwrites whatever phantom\0avalue such an early transaction left behind. initialize() sets the\0amarker, so a freshly deployed market can never be re-seeded.\00\00\00\10seed_open_counts\00\00\00\02\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\09positions\00\00\00\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06orders\00\00\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\03\ed\00\00\00\00\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0cNoetherError\00\00\00\00\00\00\01BPermissionless solvency check: flips the asset's ADL flag on when\0apool coverage (buffer + LP USDC) falls under adl_trigger_ratio_bps\0aof the payable winner uPnL, and off again above the clear ratio\0a(hysteresis). Returns the flag. Pause-exempt, lenient price read \e2\80\94\0ait must work in exactly the stress states it exists for.\00\00\00\00\00\11check_adl_trigger\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\05asset\00\00\00\00\00\00\11\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\00\01\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0cNoetherError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\b5L1-18: rolling 14-day traded volume for a trader \e2\80\94 the referral\0aregistry's create_code gate cross-reads this (min_code_volume).\0aRead-only local window rotation, nothing persisted.\00\00\00\00\00\00\11get_trader_volume\00\00\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06trader\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\04\00Place a limit entry order.\0aCollateral is locked immediately when the order is placed.\0aOrder executes when price reaches trigger_price (based on trigger_condition).\0a\0a# Arguments\0a* `trader` - Address of the trader\0a* `asset` - Asset symbol (e.g., \22BTC\22, \22ETH\22, \22XLM\22)\0a* `direction` - Long or Short\0a* `collateral` - USDC collateral to lock (7 decimals)\0a* `leverage` - Leverage multiplier (1-10)\0a* `trigger_price` - Price at which to execute (7 decimals)\0a* `trigger_above` - true = execute when price >= trigger, false = when price <= trigger\0a* `slippage_tolerance_bps` - Max allowed slippage in basis points (e.g., 100 = 1%)\0a\0a# Returns\0aThe created Order\0aPlace a limit order.\0a\0a# Time-in-Force (`time_in_force` parameter)\0a- `0` = GTC (Good Till Cancel) \e2\80\94 stays open until triggered or cancelled\0a- `1` = IOC (Immediate Or Cancel) \e2\80\94 executes immediately if conditions met, else cancelled\0a- `2` = Post Only \e2\80\94 rejected if it would execute immediately (guarantees maker fee)\0a\0a# Reduce Only (bit 8 of `time_in_force`)\0aIf `time_in_\00\00\00\11place_limit_order\00\00\00\00\00\00\09\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06trader\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\05asset\00\00\00\00\00\00\11\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\09direction\00\00\00\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\09Direction\00\00\