d of estimating from the gateway). Read-only: the\0arolling window rotates on a LOCAL copy, nothing is persisted.\00\00\00\00\13get_trader_fee_info\00\00\00\00\01\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06trader\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\01\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0dTraderFeeInfo\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\d0Open a cross-margin position. Single transaction: if pool balance is\0ainsufficient, automatically transfers the shortfall from trader's wallet.\0aWorks like Binance cross-margin: no separate deposit step needed.\00\00\00\13open_position_cross\00\00\00\00\06\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06trader\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\05asset\00\00\00\00\00\00\11\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0acollateral\00\00\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\08leverage\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\09direction\00\00\00\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\09Direction\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\10acceptable_price\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\08Position\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0cNoetherError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00|Place a trailing stop order attached to a position.\0aTracks peak price, triggers when price drops trailing_percent from peak.\00\00\00\13place_trailing_stop\00\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06trader\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0bposition_id\00\00\00\00\06\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\14trailing_percent_bps\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\16slippage_tolerance_bps\00\00\00\00\00\04\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\05Order\00\00\00\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0cNoetherError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00SClose a cross-margin position. PnL returns to cross-margin pool, not trader wallet.\00\00\00\00\14close_position_cross\00\00\00\03\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\06trader\00\00\00\00\00\13\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\0bposition_id\00\00\00\00\06\00\00\00\00\00\00\00\10acceptable_price\00\00\00\0b\00\00\00\01\00\00\03\e9\00\00\00\0b\00\00\07\d0\00\00\00\0cNoetherError\00\00\00\00\00\00\00qDeposit USDC into cross-margin pool.\0aFunds are held by the Market contract and shared across all cross positions.\00\00\